WEBVTT

02:42.500 --> 02:46.000
<b>Captain, why do I feel like there's
the aura of the Black Vatican?</b>

02:47.500 --> 02:48.790
<b>Look at this.</b>

02:49.920 --> 02:51.040
<b>Dark Beast Monster?</b>

02:51.500 --> 02:53.960
<b>It's the critical moment where
the undead are sieging the city.</b>

02:54.040 --> 02:56.500
<b>If the Black Vatican is taking advantage
of the situation to cause harm,</b>

02:56.580 --> 02:57.880
<b>it will be devastating.</b>

02:57.960 --> 02:59.460
<b>We must report this immediately!</b>

03:00.250 --> 03:02.750
<b>We don't know if there are survivors.</b>

03:22.540 --> 03:24.290
<b>The battle is almost over.</b>

03:27.500 --> 03:29.290
<b>Everyone is exhausted...</b>

03:35.290 --> 03:36.750
<b>Ever since late summer,</b>

03:36.830 --> 03:39.210
<b>the nights have become a
wild party for the undead.</b>

03:39.880 --> 03:43.580
<b>However, for you, this could
very well be an opportunity.</b>

03:43.670 --> 03:45.290
<b>Hm? What do you mean?</b>

03:47.960 --> 03:50.960
<b>Meditation alone isn't
enough to reach advanced-tier.</b>

03:51.630 --> 03:56.630
<b>I believe you relied on some treasures
when leveling up to intermediate tier.</b>

03:57.080 --> 04:00.330
<b>Mo Fan, I think you need a breakthrough.</b>

04:01.750 --> 04:04.330
<b>You seem very concerned
about my progress.</b>

04:04.790 --> 04:07.580
<b>Not just me. A lot of people are.</b>

04:07.670 --> 04:10.750
<b>Huh? What are you guys...
trying to do?</b>

04:11.920 --> 04:13.670
<b>It's because you're a freak.</b>

04:13.750 --> 04:15.380
<b>You already have four elements right now.</b>

04:15.460 --> 04:17.290
<b>Once you reach advanced-tier,
you can awaken two more.</b>

04:17.380 --> 04:18.540
<b>That's six elements!</b>

04:18.630 --> 04:21.080
<b>You're a one-man mage squad!</b>

04:23.580 --> 04:25.790
<b>Why do you think the big guys
all have their eyes on you?</b>

04:27.880 --> 04:30.290
<b>That's just what Old Bao
told you guys, right?</b>

04:30.380 --> 04:32.830
<b>With the effects of Spirit or
Soul-grade Seeds for different elements,</b>

04:32.920 --> 04:37.540
<b>even the power of two advanced mages
combined couldn't compare to you!</b>

04:39.290 --> 04:40.790
<b>It all sounds good on paper...</b>

04:41.380 --> 04:43.540
<b>Do you have any idea how broke I am?</b>

04:44.630 --> 04:47.290
<b>Heh. Fair enough.</b>

04:47.670 --> 04:48.750
<b>So I recommend you focus on</b>

04:48.830 --> 04:51.170
<b>getting your fire element
to advanced-tier Galaxia first,</b>

04:51.250 --> 04:54.130
<b>then you'll be able to awaken
your fifth and sixth elements.</b>

04:55.920 --> 04:57.330
<b>If I were the Black Vatican,</b>

04:57.420 --> 05:00.040
<b>I would just strangle you,
you little weirdo.</b>

05:00.130 --> 05:03.250
<b>Otherwise, you could take down their
entire organization by yourself one day...</b>

05:16.380 --> 05:17.710
<b>They've succeeded!</b>

05:18.460 --> 05:19.460
<b>Who?</b>

05:19.540 --> 05:21.170
<b>The Phantom Tyrant Emperor has been slain!</b>

05:21.250 --> 05:23.040
<b>Our army is withdrawing
to the city walls!</b>

05:28.420 --> 05:30.920
<b>What's going on? You're
leaving the city right now?</b>

05:31.000 --> 05:33.210
<b>There's a squad that's
surrounded by skeletons.</b>

05:33.290 --> 05:34.670
<b>We're going to provide backup.</b>

05:37.000 --> 05:38.250
<b>Should we go help?</b>

05:39.130 --> 05:41.960
<b>No need. We're both out of magical energy.</b>

05:42.040 --> 05:43.420
<b>It'd be pointless.</b>

05:44.920 --> 05:46.830
<b>Besides, the sun is almost up.</b>

05:46.920 --> 05:48.960
<b>And the Phantom Tyrant
Emperor has been annihilated.</b>

05:50.500 --> 05:53.330
<b>That's true. Once the sun
is up, they'll retreat.</b>

06:09.960 --> 06:13.460
<b>Damn it! We should have
never left that zone!</b>

06:15.290 --> 06:17.130
<b>The army's already gone
back to the city walls!</b>

06:17.210 --> 06:19.460
<b>But us escorts are all trapped here!</b>

06:20.880 --> 06:21.920
<b>Hang in there a bit longer!</b>

06:22.000 --> 06:23.420
<b>We'll be fine once the sun comes up!</b>

06:30.830 --> 06:32.130
<b>Where's Xiaoding?!</b>

06:34.040 --> 06:35.500
<b>Where did Xiaoding go?!</b>

06:36.210 --> 06:38.880
<b>You bastard! I told you to watch him!</b>

06:44.290 --> 06:45.330
<b>Xiaoding!</b>

06:46.580 --> 06:50.330
<b>How... How am I going to face your sister?</b>

07:02.250 --> 07:04.960
<b>Li Cong... is dead, too, I think...</b>

07:06.630 --> 07:08.750
<b>Why is the sun still not rising?!</b>

07:10.580 --> 07:11.880
<b>The sun...</b>

07:12.790 --> 07:13.830
<b>The sun...</b>

07:17.460 --> 07:18.380
<b>What are you doing?!</b>

07:18.460 --> 07:20.250
<b>Do you want to die here?!</b>

07:20.330 --> 07:22.580
<b>Dig deep and give me
some fighting spirit right now!</b>

07:24.710 --> 07:25.710
<b>Captain...</b>

07:26.330 --> 07:29.630
<b>The sun... rose a long time ago...</b>

07:42.830 --> 07:44.630
<b>The sun... really did rise...</b>

07:50.330 --> 07:51.380
<b>Why...</b>

07:52.080 --> 07:53.210
<b>Why?</b>

08:16.880 --> 08:18.920
<b>Where's my boss? Is he all right?</b>

08:20.000 --> 08:23.000
<b>He's fine, but just barely.</b>

08:23.670 --> 08:25.960
<b>That guy really has no sense
of self-preservation.</b>

08:26.040 --> 08:28.170
<b>But without his risky move,</b>

08:28.250 --> 08:30.880
<b>the Phantom Tyrant Emperor
might've escaped.</b>

08:32.580 --> 08:35.170
<b>How about you? How was your performance?</b>

08:35.250 --> 08:36.880
<b>Nothing crazy.</b>

08:36.960 --> 08:40.670
<b>Killed just a little bit more
than those mages you gathered.</b>

08:42.580 --> 08:44.830
<b>He helped me slay a Corpse Official.</b>

08:45.290 --> 08:47.380
<b>You don't seem like a student at all.</b>

08:47.460 --> 08:51.000
<b>Anyone who didn't know would take you
for a battle-hardened veteran hunter.</b>

08:52.330 --> 08:54.380
<b>The others are heading back now.</b>

08:54.460 --> 08:58.130
<b>There weren't too many casualties
this time. It's a decisive victory.</b>

08:58.960 --> 09:00.960
<b>Senator, your injuries aren't light.</b>

09:01.080 --> 09:02.420
<b>You should get treated first.</b>

09:12.580 --> 09:13.960
<b>The sun is finally up!</b>

09:14.040 --> 09:16.380
<b>Those damn undead have
to leave, after all!</b>

09:17.830 --> 09:20.960
<b>I want to head back and
take a hot shower, too!</b>

09:24.130 --> 09:25.210
<b>What's wrong?</b>

09:25.920 --> 09:27.630
<b>I worry that my eyes
are deceiving me.</b>

09:27.710 --> 09:32.170
<b>Take a look, and tell me
my eyes are mistaken!</b>

10:08.630 --> 10:10.170
<b>How could this happen?</b>

10:10.250 --> 10:11.830
<b>How could this possibly be happening?!</b>

10:12.250 --> 10:13.210
<b>The sun is up!</b>

10:13.290 --> 10:14.670
<b>The sun is already up!</b>

10:14.750 --> 10:16.750
<b>Why are they still here?!</b>

10:22.500 --> 10:24.040
<b>Wasn't it already over?</b>

10:24.130 --> 10:26.790
<b>For millennia, undead haven't
walked in the light of day.</b>

10:26.880 --> 10:28.630
<b>Just... Just what is going on?!</b>

10:38.880 --> 10:40.170
<b>Nether Bone Ruler!</b>

10:43.670 --> 10:45.130
<b>The ruler of skeletons...</b>

10:45.750 --> 10:47.750
<b>Even it has awoken in the light of dawn...</b>

10:59.670 --> 11:00.830
<b>Take cover!</b>

11:25.580 --> 11:28.080
<b>You... You bastard!</b>

11:29.290 --> 11:30.540
<b>I'm going to kill that thing!</b>

11:30.630 --> 11:32.460
<b>I'm going to slay it!</b>

11:32.960 --> 11:35.080
<b>Hey! Are you throwing your life away?!</b>

11:35.170 --> 11:36.170
<b>In the eyes of that thing,</b>

11:36.250 --> 11:38.960
<b>you're not even a
cockroach under its foot.</b>

11:39.040 --> 11:40.130
<b>Leave me be!</b>

11:40.210 --> 11:41.710
<b>Let me go!</b>

11:45.170 --> 11:48.710
<b>Let go of me, please!
I beg you! Let go of me!</b>

11:48.790 --> 11:51.920
<b>My wife... My soon-to-be-born son...</b>

11:52.000 --> 11:57.290
<b>They're all there... They're all there!</b>

11:58.750 --> 12:00.880
<b>Mo Fan, I'm begging you...</b>

12:00.960 --> 12:05.290
<b>If you still think of me as
a friend, then let me go...</b>

12:07.380 --> 12:10.420
<b>What a coincidence. I don't
think of you as a friend.</b>

12:13.920 --> 12:16.960
<b>I understand how you feel, but as a mage,</b>

12:17.080 --> 12:19.130
<b>we have so many other things we must do.</b>

12:19.210 --> 12:20.330
<b>We can risk our lives to fight,</b>

12:20.420 --> 12:22.210
<b>but we can't throw away
our lives for nothing.</b>

12:27.830 --> 12:29.540
<b>Guys, look!</b>

12:32.830 --> 12:34.710
<b>Purple... Purple alert!</b>

12:34.790 --> 12:37.380
<b>I've never seen this in my life!</b>

12:37.460 --> 12:39.790
<b>Do the higher-ups think we
can't hold the north wall anymore?</b>

12:40.330 --> 12:42.460
<b>Then what do we do? Do we
hold, or do we retreat?</b>

12:42.540 --> 12:44.250
<b>Let's see what the senator
and the others say!</b>

12:48.040 --> 12:51.130
<b>Out of the way! Don't block the way!</b>

12:51.210 --> 12:52.210
<b>Come help!</b>

12:52.290 --> 12:54.960
<b>Let the kids go first!
Get people to come help!</b>

12:55.080 --> 12:56.250
<b>Run, run!</b>

13:07.210 --> 13:08.330
<b>Run quickly!</b>

13:12.580 --> 13:13.830
<b>Wait for me!</b>

13:34.630 --> 13:36.080
<b>- Du Xiao, don't!
- Calm down!</b>

13:57.330 --> 14:00.960
<b>Big Ruler... Mountain Zombie...</b>

14:01.750 --> 14:04.540
<b>So the Nether Bone Ruler was
only second-in-command...</b>

14:04.630 --> 14:06.380
<b>This one is the true commander!</b>

14:06.790 --> 14:10.250
<b>The Mountain Zombie and the Black
Totem Snake are from the same era.</b>

14:10.330 --> 14:11.960
<b>Even with the four of us at our peak,</b>

14:12.080 --> 14:14.750
<b>we might still fail to hold up
against the Nether Bone Ruler...</b>

14:14.830 --> 14:17.000
<b>Let alone this guy...</b>

14:18.710 --> 14:20.210
<b>Listen to the orders from the higher-ups.</b>

14:20.290 --> 14:22.500
<b>Everyone, immediately retreat
to the barrier inside the city.</b>

14:22.580 --> 14:23.670
<b>Yes, sir!</b>

14:25.830 --> 14:27.750
<b>We're giving up on the
outer wall just like this?</b>

14:27.830 --> 14:29.540
<b>We're not going to
fight even a little more?</b>

14:31.250 --> 14:33.500
<b>If any one of us here becomes
a needless sacrifice,</b>

14:33.580 --> 14:37.210
<b>we'll lose far more people in the future.</b>

14:37.540 --> 14:39.040
<b>I'll go give the order.</b>

14:40.290 --> 14:41.960
<b>Have every department retreat.</b>

14:42.080 --> 14:44.580
<b>Have them help as many refugees
as possible on the way.</b>

14:48.250 --> 14:50.880
<b>You should go, too. To the inner city.</b>

14:51.500 --> 14:54.750
<b>We all must stay alive.
Otherwise, there's no hope.</b>

14:56.880 --> 14:58.790
<b>You should know that I'm from Bo City...</b>

14:59.540 --> 15:01.380
<b>Whether you believe me or not,</b>

15:01.460 --> 15:03.580
<b>I'm smelling the scent
of the Black Vatican.</b>

15:09.040 --> 15:11.830
<b>The Black Vatican? How so?</b>

15:13.540 --> 15:14.580
<b>The rain.</b>

15:18.290 --> 15:19.580
<b>You're saying...</b>

15:19.670 --> 15:23.750
<b>that these undead can move around
in the daylight because of this rain?</b>

15:24.380 --> 15:27.420
<b>But even when Tin City rained in the past,</b>

15:27.500 --> 15:30.420
<b>we'd never heard of undead
becoming this wild!</b>

15:33.380 --> 15:36.830
<b>I don't know how those Black
Vatican bastards are doing it,</b>

15:37.670 --> 15:41.670
<b>but this disaster looks just like
what happened in Bo City!</b>

15:42.540 --> 15:46.460
<b>The same lack of warning,
the same heavy rain,</b>

15:46.540 --> 15:48.750
<b>the same wild behavior from everything!</b>

15:49.500 --> 15:52.960
<b>You might think that these two incidents
of rain are just coincidence,</b>

15:53.080 --> 15:54.710
<b>but I think they're connected.</b>

15:55.380 --> 15:59.130
<b>These things don't just happen
for no reason out of nowhere.</b>

15:59.210 --> 16:00.170
<b>Do you have proof?</b>

16:00.250 --> 16:01.580
<b>Just a hunch.</b>

16:02.130 --> 16:03.630
<b>And my own experiences.</b>

16:04.790 --> 16:06.500
<b>I can't speak much
on this guy's character,</b>

16:06.580 --> 16:08.540
<b>but I do think his
intuition is quite sharp.</b>

16:09.130 --> 16:12.920
<b>We at the Clearsky Hunter Agency had
fragmented leads from hunting Salang.</b>

16:13.000 --> 16:14.170
<b>Everything pointed to Tin City.</b>

16:14.750 --> 16:16.080
<b>But we were too late.</b>

16:16.170 --> 16:17.830
<b>Salang...</b>

16:18.460 --> 16:19.750
<b>I understand.</b>

16:19.830 --> 16:21.210
<b>You, come with us.</b>

16:27.130 --> 16:30.130
<b>You might not make it to
the inner city safely by yourself!</b>

16:30.210 --> 16:32.460
<b>I have some friends at the outer walls.</b>

16:32.540 --> 16:34.500
<b>I need to bring them
with me and retreat.</b>

16:37.250 --> 16:38.210
<b>Then I'll send people—</b>

16:38.290 --> 16:40.460
<b>No need. I'll be fine on my own.</b>

16:40.540 --> 16:42.040
<b>Your men are very valuable.</b>

16:42.130 --> 16:43.750
<b>Go save those who need saving.</b>

16:44.830 --> 16:47.080
<b>I've trained so hard all these years</b>

16:47.170 --> 16:49.580
<b>just so I wouldn't be like
how I was back in Bo City...</b>

16:49.670 --> 16:52.580
<b>All I could do when faced with
disaster back then was survive.</b>

16:54.500 --> 16:57.210
<b>It's certainly true that those from
Bo City become impressively brave</b>

16:57.290 --> 16:59.460
<b>at the mention of the Black Vatican.</b>

17:01.250 --> 17:04.040
<b>My magical energy hasn't
recovered yet. I can't help you.</b>

17:04.130 --> 17:05.250
<b>I'll see you in the inner city.</b>

17:06.460 --> 17:07.630
<b>See you inside.</b>

17:30.290 --> 17:33.210
<b>Translator: Bridget Kan</b>

17:33.290 --> 17:36.210
<b>Editor: Salem Alabanza</b>

17:36.290 --> 17:39.210
<b>Quality Control: Gabriella Alabanza</b>

17:39.290 --> 17:42.290
<b>Timer and Final Quality Control:
Henry Lin</b>

19:03.420 --> 19:06.040
<b><i>Is this guy... also attacking the city?!</i></b>

19:06.130 --> 19:08.750
<b><i>To think those bastards still had</i>
<i>this trick up their sleeves!</i></b>

19:08.830 --> 19:11.170
<b><i>Now we really can't say if</i>
<i>we'll outrun them or not!</i></b>

19:11.250 --> 19:12.500
<b><i>We have to outrun them!</i></b>

19:12.580 --> 19:14.130
<b><i>Otherwise, we'll all die!</i></b>

19:16.420 --> 19:17.630
<b><i>All imperial mages, listen up!</i></b>

19:18.170 --> 19:19.290
<b><i>Towards the outer city!</i></b>

19:19.380 --> 19:21.040
<b><i>Eliminate the Flesh</i>
<i>Mound Corpse Officials!</i></b>

19:24.830 --> 19:26.420
<b><i>I've had it!</i></b>

19:26.500 --> 19:28.290
<b><i>Let's slay this undead bastard!</i></b>
